Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.14,0:02:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,彭彭  看看这小家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, Pumbaa, look at that little guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.72,0:03:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,真是他老爸的翻版{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chip off the old block!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道谁会来抚养他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And ya gotta know who's gonna raise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.23,0:03:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-他父母?  -对了  当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- His parents? - Okay, sure. Get technical.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.52,0:03:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但说真的  谁要来教他真正重要的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But who's gonna teach him the really important stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,像是怎么打嗝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like how to belch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.86,0:03:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,和怎么觅食{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And dig for grubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.74,0:03:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,老伙伴  我跟你说  这就像以前一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm tellin' ya, buddy, it's gonna be like old times...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.62,0:03:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你  我和这小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, me, and the little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是个女孩  -女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It is a girl. - Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-女孩?  -女孩?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Girl? Oy. - Girl? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.29,0:03:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,《狮子王2：辛巴的荣耀》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.44,0:03:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.19,0:03:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么匆忙是要去哪里啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you think you're going in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.03,0:03:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,爸...  放开我啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy! Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是希望你小心一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I just want you to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.62,0:04:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅  你听进去没有?  意外随时会发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara, are you listening? Accidents can happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.63,0:04:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-你很可能会受伤或跌倒  -还有一不小心就会迷路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You could easily get hurt - "Hurt, or stepped on, or even get lost."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.55,0:04:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,还有  记住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And remember
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.64,0:04:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-我要你待在荣耀石范围里  片刻不离  -片刻不离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want you to stay in sight of Pride Rock at all times. - "...at all times."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.14,0:04:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道  如果我看到陌生人  别和他们说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. "And if I see any strangers, don't talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.39,0:04:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,马上回家来  好  好  我能走了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come straight home." Okay, okay. Can I go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.65,0:04:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-真爱耍宝  -要听爸爸的话  琪拉雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Very funny. - Mind your father, Kiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-好的  妈妈  -离蛮荒之地远一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, Mom. - And stay away from the outlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那里只有一群会暗箭伤人的  可怕的荒原人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing there but a bunch of backstabbing, murderous outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.75,0:04:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,沙祖说得对  你绝对不能背对着他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zazu's right. You can't turn your back on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真的?  为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.67,0:04:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  你只管去玩吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind. Just run along now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.51,0:04:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-但是  爸爸  我...  -你将来就会了解的  去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But, Dad, l... - You'll understand someday. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.35,0:05:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,待在我替你做过记号的路上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And stay on the path I've marked for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  她让你想起了谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba. Who does she remind you of, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.69,0:05:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯?  什么?  谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh? What? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她就跟你年轻的时候一模一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's just like you were when you were young.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.03,0:05:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没有错  你知道这会给我们带来什么危险?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly! Do you realize the dangers we put ourselves in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说就像你以前一样吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean the dangers you put us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.38,0:05:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她会没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.43,0:05:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,丁满  彭彭  过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Timon! Pumbaa! Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.77,0:05:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,早安  我的老大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, mon capitaine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你们帮我多盯着琪拉雅一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to keep a close watch on Kiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.23,0:05:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道她很会乱跑的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know she's bound to run off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.65,0:05:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,放心  我们会像疣猪的臭味一样紧跟着她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, Simba, we're on her like stink on a warthog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.65,0:05:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么!  -这是事实嘛  彭彭  接受吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! - It's a hard truth, Pumbaa. Live with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,两位  我就靠你们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,每个石头后面都有可能潜伏着危机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danger could be lurking behind every rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  回来啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Wait! Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想玩啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.72,0:06:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的猎人已经困住她的猎物了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mighty hunter has cornered her prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哇...  好酷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.57,0:06:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是蛮荒之地耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The outlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.28,0:06:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道那里有什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder what's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心  琪拉雅  彭彭伯伯来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, don't worry, Kiara. Uncle Pumbaa's comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,噢  不...  呃...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! Oh! Uh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看  嗨  辛巴  好消息是我们找到你的女儿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see. "Gee, Simba, the good news is we found your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.15,0:07:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,坏消息是...  有只疣猪压到她了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The bad news is we dropped a warthog on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么意见没有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a problem with that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅  琪拉雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara? Kiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,彭彭  辛巴要你盯着她  不是压扁她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa! Let me define "baby-sitting."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅小公主  身为辛巴的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Princess Kiara, as Simba's daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道不该单独跑这么远的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know better than to go off all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.01,0:07:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-你可能会受伤  -但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You could have been hurt. - Bu-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,受伤?  噢  辛巴会杀了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurt? Oh, Simba would kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.77,0:07:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-你的背没伤到吧?  -但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You didn't slip a disk, did ya? - Bu-Bu...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-发烧了吗?  刺到指甲了?  -丁满...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Catch a fever? Get a hangnail? - Aah! Timon...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.27,0:07:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-我曾刺到过  -非常痛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I had one once. - Very painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,非常折磨人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excruciating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的  你那细嫩的肌肤  应该远离太阳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling, with your complexion, you should stay out of the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:07:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么?  你想增加皱纹?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Do you wanna wrinkle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你们听我说好不好?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will somebody please just listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.45,0:08:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起  我没在听  公主  你刚才说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I wasn't listening. Did you say something, Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我不只是一个公主  那只是我身份的一部份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not just a princess, you know. That's only half of who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-那另外一部份是什么?  -呃  这个...  我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, uh, who's the other half? - Oh, well, l, uh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.51,0:08:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,趁你在想的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, while you're figuring it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,来吃东西吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,虫子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are! Grubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是白肉的一种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other white meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-而且蛋白质丰富  -好恶心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And so high in protein. - Eww! Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.65,0:08:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不要?  你呢  猪大爷?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No? How 'bout you, big boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-我爱虫子  -不是喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ah! Love grubs. - Not "like."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么这样子啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! You always do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,每次都是咬一口  然后又放回去  快把我逼疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take a bite out of every one, and then put it back. It drives me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但是从外表没办法确定哪个是黏黏的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can't tell from the outside which are the real slimy ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.68,0:08:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,黏黏的?  彭彭  我的猪大爷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slimy? Pumbaa, my corpulent compadre,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.10,0:08:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是脆脆的虫子比较好吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's the crunchy ones that make the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-黏的  -脆的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Slimy. - Crunchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.89,0:09:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-黏的  黏的  黏的...  -脆的  脆的  脆的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-Slimy! Slimy! Slimy! -Crunchy! Crunchy! Crunchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.61,0:09:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-黏的  馅少  -脆的  好吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Slimy! Slimy! Less filling. - Crunchy! Crunchy! Tastes good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-馅少  -好吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Less filling. Less filling. - Tastes good. Tastes good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁?  荣耀国的人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you, pride lander?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-你在干什么?  -我爸爸说过  绝对不要背对着荒原人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - My father says to never turn your back on an outsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-你总是听你爸爸的话吗?  -才不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You always do what Daddy says? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.65,0:09:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是  你一定是你爸爸的小宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bet ya do! Bet you're Daddy's little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.45,0:09:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,荒原人不需要任何人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An outsider doesn't need anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我会照顾我自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好酷哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.10,0:10:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,往这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.27,0:10:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚实在好险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.09,0:10:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  我该怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wh-what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.00,0:10:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我会引开他们  快跑啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I-I'll distract him! Run! Whoops!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,小心啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.14,0:11:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我成功了  我成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did it! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,老天哪  你看那牙齿有多大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ho, man, did you see the size of those teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他那样...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were going, "Rr, rr, rr, rr."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.97,0:11:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他差一点就吃到我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just totally ate me up right there,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.35,0:11:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,而我跳到他头上  然后狠狠地揍他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I jumped on his head, and I popped him so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们真的合作无间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We make such a good team!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.85,0:11:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你...  你真的好勇敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you... You were really brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗  你也很勇敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? You were pretty brave too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-我叫做高孚  -我是琪拉雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My name's Kovu. - I'm Kiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.66,0:11:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,跑  我追{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tag! You're it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,跑  我追...  你跑啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tag! You're it! You're it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.55,0:12:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你跑  我追  懂吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? You run, I tag. Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了  你不知道怎么玩吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter? Don't you know how to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.40,0:12:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-吉娜  -辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Zira. - Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.91,0:12:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-娜娜  -吉娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nala. - Zira.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.91,0:12:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,丁满  彭彭  真好  现在我们互相都认识了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon, Pumbaa. Great! Now that we all know each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.17,0:12:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-马上滚出我们的荣耀国  -你们的荣耀国?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get out of our pride lands! - Your pride lands?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.22,0:12:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这片土地属于刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These lands belong to Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我从荣耀国把你驱逐出去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I banished you from the pride lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:13:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,现在  你和你的小狮子  快滚吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you and your young cub, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没见过我的儿子高孚吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, haven't you met my son, Kovu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.11,0:13:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他是刀疤亲选的继承人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was hand-chosen by Scar to follow in his paw prints,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.78,0:13:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,也是我们这片土地上未来的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and become king.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.62,0:13:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他才不是国王  而是一个毛头小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pfft! That's not a king. That's a fuzzy maraca.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.46,0:13:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,高孚出生在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kovu was the last born...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.05,0:13:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我们赶到蛮荒地之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before you exiled us to the outlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.63,0:13:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在那儿  食物和水都比较少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where we have little food, less water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.39,0:13:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道回荣耀国的惩罚是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the penalty for returning to the pride lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子并不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the child does not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  如果你急着要讨债的话  请便{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, if you need your pound of flesh, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,带着他离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him and get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're finished here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.83,0:13:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不  辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.87,0:14:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,才刚刚开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have barely begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.05,0:14:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.22,0:14:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.90,0:14:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅  你以为你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara, what did you think you were doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天可能会送命的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have been killed today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但爸爸  我不是故意不听...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, Daddy, l-I didn't mean to diso...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.59,0:14:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你这些是因为我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you this because I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-我并不想失去你  -我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't want to lose you. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.68,0:15:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你发生了什么事  我不知道我会怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If something happened to you, I don't know what I'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天我会离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day, I won't be here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我需要你继承我的王位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I need you to carry on in my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-你是这个王国里的一员  -我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are part of the great circle of... - "Circle of life." I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,没有错  而且你必须要小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly. And you need to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.45,0:15:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-身为未来的女王...  -如果我不想当女王呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- As future queen... - What if I don't wanna be queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.79,0:15:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那又不好玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这就像你说你不想当狮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's like saying you don't wanna be a lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的血统  我也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in your blood, as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们是血脉相连{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are part of each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.27,0:15:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,当你经历过人生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you go through life you'll see
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.24,0:15:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你就会发现它有多曲折{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is so much that we don't understand
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.74,0:15:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都有心愿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the only thing we know
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但它不会轻易如你所想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is things don't always go the way we planned
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.67,0:16:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你放心  别害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you'll see every day
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.59,0:16:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会在你身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That we'll never turn away
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,当你无法实现你的梦想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When it seems all your dreams come undone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会陪伴你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will stand by your side
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,走过那灰暗时刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Filled with hope and filled with pride
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不要忘记  我们是一家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are more than we are
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are one
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are one
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.69,0:16:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are one
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是否我能逃避它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's so much I must be
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想做我自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I still just be me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,原来的我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way I am
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.14,0:17:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是否我已被选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I trust in my own heart
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是你们计划中的一部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or am I just one part of some big plan
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.53,0:17:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你放心  别害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even those who are gone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,先人会与你同在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are with us as we go on
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要勇敢往前冲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your journey has only begun
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有痛苦  有欢乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tears of pain, tears of joy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.13,0:17:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有件事你最骄傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thing nothing can destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你的荣耀的血统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is our pride deep inside
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.76,0:17:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are one
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.35,0:17:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are one
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.57,0:17:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are one
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.81,0:17:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人  你我就像天和地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are one, you and I. We are like the earth and sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.12,0:17:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,彼此散发出光和热{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One family under the sun
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:18:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,先人会指引你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the wisdom to lead
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,给你智慧和勇气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the courage that you need
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.13,0:18:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不要忘记{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will find when you see
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are one
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.10,0:18:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你住在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as you live here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.61,0:18:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.57,0:18:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你将来会了解的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll understand someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,高孚  高孚  高孚  他根本不是刀疤的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kovu, Kovu, Kovu. Scar wasn't even his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是领养的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just took him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  维塔妮  那个小讨厌高孚呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hey, Vitani, where's the little termite Kovu...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.09,0:19:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,被选上的那个?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"the Chosen One"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.01,0:19:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,努卡  高孚呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nuka, where's Kovu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.05,0:19:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是又把他一个丢在外面了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you leave him out there on his own again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.97,0:19:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里大家都得自求多福{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! It's every lion for himself out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.89,0:19:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那个小讨厌必须学会靠自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That little termite's gotta learn to be on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈一定会生气的  她叫你看好他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother's gonna be mad. She told you to watch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,管他呢  我应该被选上才对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, who cares? I shoulda been the Chosen One.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:19:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我年纪最大  而且最强壮  也是最聪明的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the oldest. I'm the strongest. I'm the smartest...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.24,0:20:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,噢  这些小臭虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, these termites!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.49,0:20:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只要她给我机会  我一定可以当个好领袖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could be a leader, if she'd just give me a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是哦  你为什么不自己去跟她说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right. Why don't you tell that to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好  别以为我不会说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Don't think I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.09,0:20:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  是吗  妈妈来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah? Here's your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什么  噢  妈妈...  嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Oh! Mother. Mother! Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.31,0:20:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈  我替你抓了些野鼠当晚餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother, I caught some field mice for your dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我把它们放在...  算了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I left 'em by the, um... by the... Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.69,0:20:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  高孚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Kovu,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.69,0:20:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,想不想玩打架?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.36,0:20:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该要好好看着他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were supposed to be watching him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.78,0:20:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是他的错  是我自己跑走的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I-It's not his fault. I went off on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-你在干什么  -没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What were you doing? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.45,0:20:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁害我们成荒原人  -辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who has made us outsiders? - Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.08,0:20:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁杀了刀疤  -辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who killed Scar? - Simba!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你难道忘了他们过去是怎么对待我们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have I told you about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.55,0:20:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起  妈妈  她...看起来没有那么坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Mother. Oh, l... she didn't seem so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.76,0:20:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我...  我以为我们能当...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, l-l-l-l... I thought we could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.97,0:21:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友?  你以为接近他女儿后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friends? You thought you'd get to the daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.31,0:21:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴就会展开双臂欢迎你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Simba would welcome you with open arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.27,0:21:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个好主意...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.98,0:21:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,多好的主意啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.82,0:21:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你这聪明的孩子  我真是以你为荣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brilliant child. I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.66,0:21:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟刀疤一样会想办法  用你的脑袋去夺得权势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the same conniving mind that made Scar so... powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.42,0:21:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugh. Yuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.47,0:21:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哼  选上的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bah. "Chosen One."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.77,0:21:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经想出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I now see the path...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.15,0:22:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,夺回权势的办法了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to our glorious return to power!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-可是我...  -安静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I don't want... - Hush!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.66,0:22:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,安静  我的小宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hush, my little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.87,0:22:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定精疲力竭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.67,0:22:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,睡吧  我的小高孚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sleep, my little Kovu
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.26,0:22:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,让美梦成真{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let your dreams take wing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.88,0:22:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,当你长得又强又壮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day when you're big and strong
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.97,0:22:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你将会称王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will be a king
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.48,0:22:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-晚安  -晚安  我的小宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good night. - Good night, my little prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.69,0:22:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,明天就要加强你的训练了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow your training intensifies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.82,0:22:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我被流放也被迫害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been exiled, persecuted
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.07,0:22:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无能力被遗弃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left alone with no defence
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.07,0:22:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,当我想起那些侮辱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I think of what that brute did
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.99,0:22:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,内心充满焦躁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get a little tense
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.41,0:22:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但我有个美丽梦想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I dream a dream so pretty
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.96,0:22:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,让我不会再诅丧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I don't feel so depressed
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.58,0:22:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,它会抚平我的怨气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause it soothes my inner kitty
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.38,0:22:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,燃起我心中希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it helps me get some rest
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.76,0:22:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,眼看那辛巴在挣扎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sound of Simba's dying gasp
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:23:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他女儿害怕在尖叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His daughter squealing in my grasp
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.18,0:23:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,听那小狮子他在哭喊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His lioness's mournful cry
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.27,0:23:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,声音多美妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my lullaby
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.11,0:23:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我也尝试忘记一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, the past I've tried forgetting
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.27,0:23:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,让悲伤离我远去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my foes I could forgive
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.86,0:23:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,只可惜...  我心眼很小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trouble is I know it's petty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.45,0:23:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这仇我不能不报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I hate to let them live
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.37,0:23:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你会发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you found yourself somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.37,0:23:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有人要取辛巴这条命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who'll chase Simba up a tree
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.79,0:23:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这场杀戮也许残酷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, the battle may be bloody
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.46,0:23:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,但它是为我而做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that kind of works for me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.25,0:23:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,听愤怒的旋律咆哮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The melody of angry growls
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.21,0:23:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看痛苦之歌在低嚎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A counterpoint of painful howls
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.05,0:23:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这交响曲在我脑海{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A symphony of death. Oh, my
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.30,0:23:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,声音多美妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my lullaby
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.96,0:23:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤死了  但吉娜还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scar is gone. But Zira's still around
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.98,0:23:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,抚养这小可爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To love this little lad
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.73,0:23:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,直到他学会做杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Till he learns to be a killer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.99,0:24:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,还要能心狠手辣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a lust for being bad
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,睡吧  你这小讨厌  我是说...  你这小可爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sleep, ya little termite. I mean, precious little thing
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.63,0:24:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,当你长得强又壮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day when you're big and strong
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.34,0:24:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你将会称王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will be a king
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.84,0:24:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那战鼓之声多震憾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pounding of the drums of war
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.30,0:24:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,它激起高孚在怒吼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thrill of Kovu's mighty roar
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.93,0:24:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-那复仇的喜悦已不远 -我作证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The joy of vengeance - Testify!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.02,0:24:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我将听到欢呼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can hear the cheering
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.10,0:24:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-高孚真勇敢 -高孚真勇敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kovu... what a guy - Kovu... what a guy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.86,0:24:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,脚步越来越近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Payback time is nearing
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.69,0:24:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,心愿就要实现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then our flag will fly
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.69,0:24:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,看旗帜在飞扬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Against a blood-red sky
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.20,0:24:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,声音多美妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my lullaby
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.05,0:25:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,噢  木法沙  琪拉雅一天比一天更美丽了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Mufasa. Every day Kiara grows more beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.89,0:25:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,并将会成为让我们引以为荣的女王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into a queen that will someday make us all very proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.40,0:25:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但是小高孚越来越强壮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this cub, Kovu, grows stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.07,0:25:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,而吉娜灌输他满心的恨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Zira fills his heart with hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.91,0:25:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常担心  木法沙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very worried, Mufasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.57,0:25:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,事情会越来越糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things are notgoing well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.00,0:25:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  你有计划?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm? You have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.75,0:25:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.76,0:25:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,高孚  琪拉雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kovu? Kiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.35,0:25:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在一起?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.35,0:25:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的计划?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.93,0:25:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗  这绝对行不通的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you crazy? This will never work.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.90,0:25:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你在上面待太久了  你的脑袋被子蒙蔽了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Mufasa, you been up there too long. Your head is in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.19,0:25:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦  好啦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay, okay. Okay, all right, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.78,0:26:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为计划行不通的  但是我相信你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think this is going to work, but I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.03,0:26:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我只希望你知道你在做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just hope you know what you are doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.96,0:26:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.55,0:26:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  非常好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm, nice. Very... nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.02,0:26:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你的灵魂中有着和刀疤一样的黑暗面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the same blackness in your soul that Scar had.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.40,0:26:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你的命运是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.48,0:26:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我将为刀疤复仇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will avenge Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.03,0:26:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-夺回他在荣耀国的地位  -没错  我怎么教你的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take his place in the pride lands. - Yes! What have I taught you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.66,0:26:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴是我们的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba is the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.91,0:26:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你现在应该怎么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what must you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.50,0:26:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.68,0:27:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定很骄傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be so proud of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.76,0:27:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这是琪拉雅第一次出去打猎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Kiara's first hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.64,0:27:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-她来了...  -琪拉雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There she is! - Kiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.94,0:27:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-你做得到的  -今天就看你的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can do it. - It's your day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.45,0:27:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪  你长大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My, how you've grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.87,0:27:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你会做得很好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm. You'll do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.46,0:27:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸  你得保证让我自己做这件事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy? You have to promise to let me do this on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.68,0:27:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,答应吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.55,0:27:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我答应你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.12,0:28:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,看好她别让她受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure she doesn't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.28,0:28:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,土狼跑掉以后  这个地方更吓人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eww. This place is even creepier since the hyenas ran off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.95,0:28:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不怕呢  行吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not scared, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.87,0:28:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不知道我们干嘛来这里而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't know why we have to be here, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.54,0:28:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,如果高孚那么特别  他干嘛需要我们?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Kovu is so special, why does he need us?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.90,0:28:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我连个机会都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never even had a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.97,0:29:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it! Well, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.10,0:29:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅开始打猎了  我们得快行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara has started her hunt. We have to move quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.56,0:29:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,火灾  哈...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.31,0:29:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,报告你的位置  听到请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tango Charlie Alpha. What's your position?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.73,0:29:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,站立着  头有点偏向左边  尾巴垂直{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... upright? Head turned slightly to the left, tail erect.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.32,0:29:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我干嘛多事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do I bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.65,0:29:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.61,0:30:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这里一定是鹿和羚羊玩的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This must be where the deer and the antelope play.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.35,0:30:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,丁满  你到这儿来干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.94,0:30:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,买东西啊  我们想替家里添置毛皮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, shopping! We thought a nice pelt for the den,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.23,0:30:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,坐垫和香料...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some throw pillows, a little potpourri...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.32,0:30:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸派你来的  他还答应让我自己来的  他说谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father sent you. After he promised to let me do this on my own, he lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.62,0:30:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不  他只是不希望你受伤啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. He just doesn't want you to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.54,0:30:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我早该知道  他不会给我真正的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have known he'd never give me a real chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.21,0:30:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我会自己打猎  远离这个荣耀国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do this on my own! Away from the pride lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.21,0:30:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  回来啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Wait! Come back! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.11,0:30:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,回来啊  琪拉雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.09,0:30:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,她又这么跑掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh-ho! she's gone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.76,0:31:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,该有人在她脖子上系个铃铛的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somebody's gotta get a beeper for this kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.23,0:31:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,点火  快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's light fires!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.70,0:31:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,烧焦的公主  烧焦的公主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roasty-toasty princess roasty-toasty princess
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.29,0:31:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是真热还是我的幻觉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, is it hot in here, or is that just me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.63,0:31:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,失火了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.71,0:31:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.00,0:32:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,计划正在进行  去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The plan is in motion. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.42,0:32:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不要担心  辛巴  她不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, Simba. She'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.09,0:32:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还能怎么样呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What could happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.22,0:32:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不...  琪拉雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! Kiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.60,0:32:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,沙祖  先飞过去  去找她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zazu! Fly ahead! Find her!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.20,0:34:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去告诉辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must tell Simba!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.35,0:34:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是哪里?  -你安全了  这是荣耀国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where am l? - You're safe. In the pride lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.80,0:34:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在荣耀国?  不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pride lands? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.97,0:34:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么带我到这儿来?  你以为你是谁啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you bring me here? Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.56,0:34:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我是刚刚救你一命的人耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'm the one that just saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.98,0:34:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  一切都在我的控制之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I had everything under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.58,0:34:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-我的位置看来可不是哦  -那就到别的地方去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not from where I'm standing. - Then move downwind.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.87,0:34:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.04,0:34:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,高孚?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kovu?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.54,0:34:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.88,0:34:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅  你没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara, you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.13,0:34:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸  你怎么可以不守信用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, how could you break your promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.93,0:34:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还好我那么做  我差点失去了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good thing I did. I almost lost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.55,0:35:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你不准再打猎  永远不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more hunts for you. Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.56,0:35:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但我本来做得很好  即使在高孚面前...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I was doing just fine! Even before Kovu...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.39,0:35:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,高孚?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kovu?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.69,0:35:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.02,0:35:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! You!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.15,0:35:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然敢救国王的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How dare you save the king's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.82,0:35:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你救了她?  为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved her? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.66,0:35:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-我诚挚地请求加入你的族群  -不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I humbly ask to join your pride. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.16,0:35:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你和其他荒原人都被流放了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were banished with the other outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.58,0:35:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我离开那些荒原人了  我跟他们不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have left the outsiders. I am a rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.75,0:35:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,请根据我的表现评断我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judge me now for who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.50,0:35:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我得为了没有犯过的罪而受到惩罚?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or am I to be blamed for a crime I didn't commit?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.05,0:35:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  他救了你女儿一命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, you owe him your daughter's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.74,0:35:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  陛下  很显然我们欠他人情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm, yes, sire. Clearly we are in his debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.39,0:35:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,而且皇家规矩说欠债就要还{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And royal protocol demands that all debts be paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.90,0:35:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不过在这个情况下  你可能会开先例哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though in this case, you might want to make an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.82,0:36:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲订的法律得遵循{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father's law will prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.91,0:36:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但我先保留我的裁决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For now, I reserve judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.79,0:36:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再看你到底怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.29,0:36:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哼  无赖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmph! Riffraff.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.59,0:37:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  谢谢你今天救了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, uh, thanks for saving me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.77,0:37:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是哪种猎人啊?  公主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of hunter are you, anyway... Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.31,0:37:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你在外面差点害死自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You almost got yourself killed out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.61,0:37:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么  -你要是独自外出  绝对撑不过三天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - You wouldn't last three days on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.53,0:37:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你可以当我的老师了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and I suppose you could teach me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.95,0:37:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.12,0:37:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-琪拉雅  -来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kiara! - Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.62,0:37:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  让我见识吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! Impress me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.83,0:37:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,天亮就开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We start at dawn.
