Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.13,0:46:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,去你们心中一个特别的地方  叫做...  优磐地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To a special place in your heart... called Upendi.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.76,0:47:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,在疯狂的月夜里  有一个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a place where the crazy moon
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.76,0:47:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,听那猴子唱  看那狒狒跳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Makes the monkeys sing and the baboon swoon
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.56,0:47:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,睡莲飘出芳香{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the sultry scent of the lotus bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.06,0:47:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,能让你开心  能让你快乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will carry you away
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.90,0:47:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,河马在丛林开心荡秋千{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While the hippos swing from the jungle vines
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.36,0:47:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,犀牛不停跳着那伦巴舞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the rhino rumba in a conga line
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.28,0:47:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,而火烈鸟在那缠绵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the pink flamingoes are intertwined
