Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.16,0:47:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,在优磐地  热情水果香又甜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In Upendi where the passion fruit grows sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.37,0:47:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,它的品质好  吃过忘不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's so divine that you lose your mind
