Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.39,0:47:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那个地方你一定会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No place you don't take with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.56,0:47:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好要小心  千万别摔跤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better watch your step 'cause the path is steep
