Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.50,0:49:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-晚安  -晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good night. - Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.29,0:50:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚还蛮冷的  进来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's kinda cold tonight, huh? Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.84,0:50:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.84,0:50:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在等什么  高孚?  杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you waiting for? Kovu, get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.44,0:50:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-你确定?  -非常确定  是我亲眼看到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're sure? - Affirmative. I saw it with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.11,0:50:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不  高孚不会背叛我们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Kovu cannot betray us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.12,0:50:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我必须今天告诉她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I have to tell her today.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.12,0:50:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我该从哪里说起呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, where do I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.46,0:50:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅  吉娜有个阴谋  我是其中之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Kiara, Zira had a plot, and I was part of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.46,0:50:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但我是不得已的  因为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"but I don't wanna be because...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.01,0:51:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's because I love you."
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.64,0:51:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,她绝对不会相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, she'll never believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.85,0:51:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但我必须要试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I gotta try.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.85,0:51:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅  我得和你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara, l... I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.31,0:51:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅  我不要你去跟他谈话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara, I don't want you talking with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.15,0:51:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟他谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to talk with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.59,0:51:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤无法忘却他的恨意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scar couldn't let go of his hate,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.55,0:51:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,直到最后  憎恨毁了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and in the end, it destroyed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.64,0:51:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我从来没有听过这样的说法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never heard the story of Scar that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.01,0:51:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤真的是凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He truly was a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.64,0:51:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,火也是凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire is a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.19,0:51:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候经过大火后成长的下一代  可能会更优秀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sometimes what's left behind can grow better than the generation before...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.03,0:51:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,只要给他机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if given the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.70,0:52:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不  噢  不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.83,0:52:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-为什么  辛巴  -吉娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why, Simba. - Zira.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.21,0:52:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么  而且...  还落单了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing out here... and so alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.84,0:52:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好  高孚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, Kovu.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.85,0:52:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我们一直计划的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like we always planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.22,0:52:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-你  -不  我和这件事完全没有关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You! - No! I didn't have anything to do with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.89,0:52:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,快攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.90,0:52:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.08,0:52:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶  我们逮到他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! We've got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.41,0:52:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,牢记你们的训练{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember your training!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.39,0:52:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,成小组队形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a unit!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.81,0:53:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-辛巴  -杀了他  高孚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Simba! - Get him, Kovu! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.61,0:53:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,快呀  快动手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.98,0:53:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来吧  这是为了你哟  妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do it for you, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.78,0:53:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈  你在看吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother, are you watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.83,0:53:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为你而做  也是为了我自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm doin' it for you, and I'm doin' it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.33,0:53:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,现在  是我的光荣时刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my moment of glory!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.04,0:54:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-努卡  -对不起  妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nuka! - I'm sorry, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.21,0:54:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽力了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried.
