Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.85,0:54:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.85,0:54:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸  沙祖  快求救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father! Zazu, get help!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.06,0:54:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,对  求救  马上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes! Help! At once! Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.40,0:54:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.99,0:54:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  说说话啊  出了什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, talk to me! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.58,0:54:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,高孚...  设埋伏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kovu... Ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.42,0:54:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.25,0:54:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了  伙伴  我们来帮你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right, buddy. We're here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.39,0:55:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤  照顾我可怜的努卡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scar, watch over my poor Nuka.
