Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.69,0:59:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-爸爸  求求你  再考虑一下  -从现在起没有护卫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Father, please reconsider. - You will not go anywhere...
