Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.93,1:03:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而这只因为你在我身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somehow we'll come through
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.64,1:03:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你在我身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that I've found you
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.52,1:03:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你在我身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love will find a way
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.48,1:04:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,而这只因为你在我身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know love will find a way
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.48,1:04:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.48,1:04:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are one.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.15,1:04:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.15,1:04:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离开这里吧  我们一起逃走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here. We'll run away together!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.49,1:04:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,并且建立属于我们自己的族群{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And start a pride all our own.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.37,1:04:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,高孚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kovu,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.70,1:04:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.71,1:04:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,什么  我们终于在一起了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're kidding. But we're finally together.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.17,1:04:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该和我们的族群在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our place is with our pride.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.21,1:04:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们逃走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we run away,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.38,1:04:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会永远分裂的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'll be divided forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.08,1:05:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我不相信我们又把她跟丢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe we lost her again.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.20,1:05:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这是第八千次了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the 8,000th time!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.21,1:05:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你会看好她的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were gonna watch her!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.25,1:05:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-我?  是你要看好她的  -我以为你会看好她的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Me? You were gonna watch her! - I thought you were gonna watch her!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.42,1:05:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-不  是你  -你该看好她的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, you were gonna watch her! - You were gonna watch her!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.42,1:05:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-你找死  -你这个臭疣猪  看我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, watch this! - Take that, you creepy warthog!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.05,1:05:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-说啊  -肥子  胖子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- say it! say it! - Fat. Fat. Fat. Fat.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.02,1:05:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.77,1:05:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,问得好  请问你一个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good question. Uh, let me ask you one.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.39,1:05:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-只是假设性的  -是  非常的假设{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Hippo-thetically." - Very hypothetical.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.27,1:05:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-有个家伙...  -对  但他不是狮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's this guy... - But he's not a lion.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.27,1:05:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不...  他不是狮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No, he's not a lion.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.40,1:05:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,老天  绝对不是狮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geez! Definitely not a lion!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.90,1:05:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,呃  他的女儿...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And uh, uh, his daughter, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.03,1:05:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}say... vanished.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.07,1:06:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-琪拉雅不见了?  -陛下  荒原人展开攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kiara's gone? - Sire, the outsiders are on the attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.08,1:06:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,往这边来了  要打仗了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heading this way! It's war!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.58,1:06:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,沙祖  去找琪拉雅  我们集合所有的母狮子  赶快行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zazu, find Kiara. We'll assemble the lionesses. Move. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.59,1:06:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了  辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.51,1:07:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多年以来  我只梦想着这一刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have dreamed of nothing else for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.81,1:07:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,她需要别的嗜好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oy, does she need a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.81,1:07:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,吉娜  最后的机会  回家吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last chance, Zira. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.15,1:07:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿就是家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am home.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.75,1:07:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,进攻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.59,1:07:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,攻击他眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go for the eyes!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.00,1:07:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,打他下巴  踢他下盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break his jaw! Hit him low!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.96,1:07:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他们  做该做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them! Do what you must!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.98,1:07:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办  怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do? What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.98,1:07:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只剩一件事可做  彭彭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one thing we can do, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.28,1:07:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,三十六计  走为上策  这是我们的格言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"When the going gets tough, the tough get going." That's our motto!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.53,1:08:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的格言不是  Hakunamatata?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought our motto was, "Hakuna matata."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.70,1:08:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,彭彭  别活在过去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, stop living in the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.83,1:08:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要新的格言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a new motto.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.50,1:08:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,像我说的  赶快溜吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said, let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.18,1:08:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-你漂亮的女儿在哪儿  娜娜  -维塔妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's your pretty daughter, Nala? - Vitani!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.58,1:08:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,全都不准动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't anybody move!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.79,1:08:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这已经上膛了  我薰死你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing's loaded. I'll let you have it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.78,1:08:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.32,1:08:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这算是哪门子战争啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha! Talk about your winds of war!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.73,1:08:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.51,1:09:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.29,1:09:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-琪拉雅  -高孚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kiara? - Kovu!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.63,1:09:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-让开  -闪一边去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move. - Stand aside.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.13,1:09:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸  事情到此结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy, this has to stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.97,1:09:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你比我想的还懦弱  给我让开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're even weaker than I thought. Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.77,1:09:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你绝不能伤害琪拉雅或辛巴  有我在就不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never hurt Kiara... or Simba. Not while I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.44,1:09:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别管这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.28,1:09:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,有个明智的国王曾告诉我  我们是一家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A wise king once told me, "We are one."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.24,1:10:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我那个时候不了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't understand him then.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.74,1:10:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,现在懂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.79,1:10:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-但是  他们...  -他们?  我们!  看看他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But they... - "Them"? Us! Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.54,1:10:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,和我们一样  你看到什么不同了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are us. What differences do you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.49,1:10:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,维塔妮  上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vitani... now!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.82,1:10:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不  妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.39,1:10:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.17,1:10:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,该结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.67,1:10:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you will not fight,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.55,1:10:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你也要一起领死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you will die as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.60,1:11:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,什么  你们要去哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Where are... Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.89,1:11:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,给我回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.89,1:11:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧  吉娜  该把过去的一切都遗忘了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let it go, Zira. It's time to put the past behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.90,1:11:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝对不会遗忘的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never let it go!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.95,1:11:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了你  刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is for you, Scar!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.62,1:11:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.41,1:11:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.88,1:11:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.51,1:11:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅  撑着点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Kiara!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.11,1:11:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  辛巴  河水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba! Simba, the river!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.29,1:12:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,吉娜  快抓住我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zira, give me your paw.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.17,1:12:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,吉娜  快啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zira, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.84,1:12:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.23,1:12:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.17,1:12:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.84,1:12:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽力了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.80,1:12:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,琪拉雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiara!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.05,1:13:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那真的是好勇敢啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! That was really brave!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.06,1:13:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-高孚  -琪拉雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kovu. - Oh, Kiara.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.49,1:13:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,高孚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kovu?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.65,1:13:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我错了  你属于这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wrong. You belong here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.70,1:13:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们回家吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.41,1:13:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,全都回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.95,1:14:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-我最爱这种结局了  -是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I love moments like this! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.62,1:14:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不是喜欢  是爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love! Not "like,"
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.29,1:14:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.81,1:15:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子  干得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.49,1:15:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are one.
